{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1OZXctTG9vay0lMjgyMDI0LSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"The New Look","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aQBpF8VmEIgow41OL9h4nU4WN6v.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/maeYVcecFyMcvOf3GISqGodgTXG.jpg","description":"The shocking story of how fashion icon Christian Dior and his contemporaries including Coco Chanel, Pierre Balmain, and Cristóbal Balenciaga navigated the horrors of World War Il and launched modern fashion.\n\nRated TV-MA · Canceled · First aired 13 Feb 2024 · United States of America · Language: English\nStudio: Apple Studios, dB-aK Pictures · Network: Apple TV\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 10/10\n\nOn your server — Audio: English (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","War & Politics","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1OZXctTG9vay0lMjgyMDI0LSUyOS8.1.1","title":"Just You Wait and See","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-02-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In Nazi-occupied Paris, Christian Dior fears for his resistance-fighter sister, Catherine. Coco Chanel makes a deal that will forever haunt her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2jOUliP7d1SYijR1Qs4ftP6vVkM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1OZXctTG9vay0lMjgyMDI0LSUyOS8.1.2","title":"The Hour","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-02-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Christian embarks on a quest to free Catherine from German captivity. Coco is sent on an undercover mission and recruits her friend Elsa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5eC0VKiKFJddS0kkibrZs5P5rvm.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L1RoZS1OZXctTG9vay0lMjgyMDI0LSUyOS8.1.3","title":"Nothing but Blue Skies","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-02-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Coco suffers the conseque